msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/1-ocs2_ros2.md:9
#: 26f9d6c368284246b08128b74b83971f
msgid "OCS2 is a Model Predictive Control (MPC) library providing:"
msgstr "OCS2 是一个模型预测控制（MPC）库，提供："

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/1-ocs2_ros2.md:10
#: 8d7c123c5ab54e398aa83f9bb9333ead
msgid "Real-time trajectory optimization"
msgstr "实时轨迹优化"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/1-ocs2_ros2.md:11
#: 6cd4bd6410ae480d9838d41b33f2bf5b
msgid "Constraint handling"
msgstr "约束处理"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/1-ocs2_ros2.md:12
#: bea8662c93c84052ba659658fa21679c
msgid "Multiple robot support (arms, mobile bases, quadrupeds)"
msgstr "支持多种机器人（机械臂、移动底盘、四足机器人）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/1-ocs2_ros2.md:14
#: 54ebe56b90f6471380bb56a0ea05ce8d
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/1-ocs2_ros2.md:16
#: 19e7a9dd27d8483a9a85a9890260c0e1
msgid "GitHub Release `.deb` (Recommended)"
msgstr "GitHub Release `.deb`（推荐）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/1-ocs2_ros2.md:18
#: fd87f39c52064bb983f0fe131363e9e5
msgid ""
"OCS2 is **not** in the ROS apt index. The package name is `ros-jazzy-"
"ocs2`; install the prebuilt `.deb` from GitHub Releases."
msgstr "OCS2 **不在** ROS apt 索引中。包名仍是 `ros-jazzy-ocs2`；请从 GitHub Releases 安装预编译 `.deb`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/1-ocs2_ros2.md:20
#: a518ac0869bd49d68a017271a7f78fe8
msgid ""
"**Most users:** run `./init_repo.sh` in `open-deploy-ws` / `fa-deploy-ws`"
" and choose `d` for OCS2 (`scripts/install_core_debs.sh`)."
msgstr "**大多数用户：** 在 `open-deploy-ws` / `fa-deploy-ws` 中运行 `./init_repo.sh`，并为 OCS2 选择 `d`（`scripts/install_core_debs.sh`）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/1-ocs2_ros2.md:22
#: bdf5acb35c6c40849f19dff065adebd0
msgid ""
"**Manual install:** download the matching asset for your architecture and"
" ROS distro from [ocs2_ros2 "
"Releases](https://github.com/legubiao/ocs2_ros2/releases), then:"
msgstr "**手动安装：** 从 [ocs2_ros2 Releases](https://github.com/legubiao/ocs2_ros2/releases) 下载匹配你架构和 ROS 发行版的资源文件，然后："

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/1-ocs2_ros2.md:24
#: f5e8fa530a2243b48653811dc861fa4a
msgid ""
"sudo dpkg -i ros-jazzy-ocs2_*.deb\n"
"sudo apt-get install -f   # if dpkg reports missing dependencies\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo dpkg -i ros-jazzy-ocs2_*.deb\n"
"sudo apt-get install -f   # if dpkg reports missing dependencies\n"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/1-ocs2_ros2.md:29
#: 7b6f7b168a654df784e9650bf231b789
msgid "From Source"
msgstr "从源码安装"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/1-ocs2_ros2.md:31
#: c9c4b014f8c04a1a8200786cfc84a0f2
msgid ""
"cd ~/your_ws/src\n"
"git clone -b ros2 https://github.com/legubiao/ocs2_ros2.git\n"
"cd ..\n"
"colcon build --packages-up-to ocs2\n"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/your_ws/src\n"
"git clone -b ros2 https://github.com/legubiao/ocs2_ros2.git\n"
"cd ..\n"
"colcon build --packages-up-to ocs2\n"

